\\name{set6}
\\alias{set6}
\\title{ARIMA Significance, Order Selection, and Residual Diagnostics}
\\description{
Inspect coefficient significance in ARIMA(2,1,2), compare candidate ARIMA orders using AIC and BIC, and examine residuals with the Durbin-Watson test and cumulative periodogram.
}
\\usage{
set6()
}
\\value{
A character string containing the practical R code.
}
\\details{
This topic is part of the \\pkg{tspracticals} practical-code reference. Use
\\code{cat(set6(), sep = "\\n")} to print the code for copying, or call
\\code{set6()} to retrieve it as a character string.
}
\\examples{
cat(set6(), sep = "\\n")
}
